Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value List IP_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value STATUS ([A-Za-z]/[A-Za-z])
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)

Start
  ^Codes:
  ^Interface\s+IP\s+Address\s+.*S/L.*Description
  ^-+\s+-+.*$$ -> Interface
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Continue

Interface
  ^\S+\s+ -> Continue.Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+.*?${STATUS}(?:\s+${DESCRIPTION})?\s*$$
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+${STATUS}(?:\s+${DESCRIPTION})?\s*$$
  ^\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Continue

EOF
